  "notes": "{蔑|さげす}む expresses contempt or looking down on someone.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n\nREGISTER:\nFairly formal or literary; the casual equivalent would be {馬鹿|ばか}にする or {見下|みくだ}す.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {人|ひと}を{蔑|さげす}む: to despise someone\n- {蔑|さげす}むような{目|め}: contemptuous eyes\n- {蔑|さげす}んだ{態度|たいど}: scornful attitude\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {蔑|ないがしろ}にする: to neglect, to disregard\n- {侮蔑|ぶべつ}: contempt, disdain (noun)\n- {見下|みくだ}す: to look down on",
